{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Five times <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />'s money added to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />'s money is more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/2/8525216ecd28baf8b6a7d3d29f7b06d3d3329216.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$51.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />. Three times <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />'s money minus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />'s money is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/1/6a166a6c7b248e96a6ccda30a53ee5b7f584b292.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$21.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />.\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> represents <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />'s money in dollars and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> represents <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />'s money in dollars, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c56f68c89b616db29d94f71768d47fab32b05cfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ a&gt;9, b&gt;6 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ a&gt;9, b&lt;6 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ a&gt;9, b=6\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ a&gt;9, \\text{but we can put no bounds on} \\text{ } b\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2a=3b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"918\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Use math symbols to write an equation and an inequality based on the conditions in the problem.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/1/df14b1300b9d95c7703fd63ab37b1e1e25b91398.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5a+b&gt;51\\]\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/9/d6958e1a0df583c21291df968bfdd5a3a103a7d6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3a-b=21\\]\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" />\nFrom the second equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/6/916d49f7b1ed05fe31c2024dcfc3d66837c5d117.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 3a-21$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/0668c9c0c1acded4f4111c790bce5bbb4be5ae7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 7 + b/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> in the inequality results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/a/ada0606166b20df09083dcc0f64e386bc8e5a00e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5a + 3a - 21 &gt; 51\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa44c957bea1d5bbdf36b10242c6b2a18954d3d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8a &gt; 72\\]\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd789d1f7829697721f9975271bcdb00562a19ee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a &gt; 9\\]\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> in the inequality results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/4248fdb01cf928d7b8570b703ade4822f64bacef.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[35 + \\frac{5b}{3} + b &gt; 51\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/1/351b87e8983693ca022af680a6e083b47448b231.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[35 + \\frac{8b}{3} &gt; 51\\]\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1be6d114107acfae49ca1a9dc6e3b3c2464be5e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{8b}{3} &gt; 16\\]\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d2fa33bf9b92f896428c692637e6116f2af48a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b &gt; 6\\]\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1960\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1960 AHSME Proble